---
layout: base.njk
noindex: true
title: Student Safety Tutorial - TofuPass
description: Six student-friendly security quizzes for password hygiene, phishing, MFA, shared devices, and account recovery. No accounts and no submitted results.
pageKey: students
extraCss:
  - /assets/css/student-test.css
pageScripts:
  - /assets/js/student-test.js
---

  <main id="main-content" class="student-test-page">
    <section class="student-test-hero" aria-labelledby="studentTestTitle">
      <div class="student-test-wrap">
        <div class="student-test-intro">
          <img width="500" height="500" src="/excited.webp" alt="" class="student-test-mascot" aria-hidden="true" />
          <p class="student-test-kicker">Security training</p>
          <h1 id="studentTestTitle">Student Safety Tutorial</h1>
          <p class="student-test-lede">Six short quizzes on passwords, phishing, two-factor codes, shared computers, recovery, and what to do when an account feels unsafe.</p>
          <p class="student-test-facts">6 quizzes · 85% to pass · No submitted results</p>
        </div>

        <section class="student-quiz-shell" aria-labelledby="quizTitle">
          <div class="module-overview" aria-label="Quiz modules">
            <div class="module-overview-head">
              <p class="student-test-kicker quiz-kicker">Tutorial progress</p>
              <strong id="moduleSummary">0 of 6 passed</strong>
            </div>
            <div id="moduleGrid" class="module-grid"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="quiz-workspace">
            <div class="quiz-topline">
              <div>
                <p id="quizKicker" class="student-test-kicker quiz-kicker">Pick a quiz</p>
                <h2 id="quizTitle">Choose a module to begin.</h2>
              </div>
              <span id="quizProgressLabel" class="quiz-progress-label" aria-live="polite">0 of 7</span>
            </div>

            <div class="quiz-progress" aria-hidden="true">
              <span id="quizProgressBar"></span>
            </div>

            <div id="moduleIntro" class="module-intro">
              <p id="moduleDescription">Pass all six quizzes with at least 85% to unlock your completion certificate.</p>
              <div class="quiz-actions">
                <button type="button" id="quizStart" class="quiz-primary">Start Quiz</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div id="quizPanel" class="quiz-panel" hidden>
              <p id="quizScenario" class="quiz-scenario"></p>
              <h3 id="quizQuestion" class="quiz-question"></h3>
              <div id="quizOptions" class="quiz-options" role="list"></div>
              <div id="quizFeedback" class="quiz-feedback" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>

              <div class="quiz-actions">
                <button type="button" id="quizCheck" class="quiz-primary" disabled>Check Answer</button>
                <button type="button" id="quizNext" class="quiz-secondary" hidden>Next</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div id="quizResults" class="quiz-results" hidden>
              <div class="result-badge">
                <span id="resultScore">0%</span>
                <strong id="resultLabel">Keep practicing</strong>
              </div>
              <p id="resultMessage" class="result-message"></p>
              <div id="resultReview" class="result-review" aria-label="Answer review"></div>
              <div class="quiz-actions">
                <button type="button" id="quizRestart" class="quiz-primary">Retake Quiz</button>
                <button type="button" id="quizNextModule" class="quiz-secondary">Next Quiz</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="certificateSection" class="certificate-section" aria-labelledby="certificateTitle" hidden>
      <div class="student-test-wrap">
        <div class="certificate-head">
          <div>
            <p class="student-test-kicker student-test-kicker-blue">Completion certificate</p>
            <h2 id="certificateTitle">Unlock the printable certificate.</h2>
          </div>
          <span id="certificateLockBadge" class="certificate-lock-badge">Locked</span>
        </div>

        <div id="certificatePanel" class="certificate-panel is-locked">
          <div class="certificate-controls">
            <label for="certificateName">Student name</label>
            <input id="certificateName" type="text" placeholder="Type student name" disabled />
            <button type="button" id="certificatePrint" class="quiz-primary" disabled>Print / Save PDF</button>
          </div>

          <article id="certificatePrintable" class="certificate-printable" aria-label="Printable completion certificate">
            <div class="certificate-border">
              <img width="512" height="512" src="/tofu.webp" alt="" class="certificate-mascot" aria-hidden="true" />
              <p class="certificate-kicker">TofuPass Safety Tutorial</p>
              <h3>Certificate of Completion</h3>
              <p class="certificate-awarded">Awarded to</p>
              <p id="certificateStudentName" class="certificate-name">Student Name</p>
              <p class="certificate-copy">for completing all six student security quizzes with passing grades.</p>
              <div class="certificate-grade-row">
                <span id="certificateGrade">Overall grade: --</span>
                <span id="certificateDate">Date: --</span>
              </div>
              <div id="certificateModules" class="certificate-modules"></div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="student-training-strip" aria-labelledby="trainingTitle">
      <div class="student-test-wrap training-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="student-test-kicker student-test-kicker-blue">What the quizzes cover</p>
          <h2 id="trainingTitle">Six habits worth repeating.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="training-points">
          <article>
            <span>1</span>
            <h3>Strong unique passwords</h3>
            <p>Readable can still be strong when the words are random and every account is different.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>2</span>
            <h3>Phishing and MFA</h3>
            <p>Students practice spotting fake sign-ins and protecting codes, prompts, and recovery keys.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>3</span>
            <h3>Shared-device safety</h3>
            <p>Logging out, reporting trouble, and avoiding saved passwords on classroom devices.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
